WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:43.419
"I lost my perfect acorn!" cried Kip.

2
00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:52.353
"This is a horrible day."

3
00:00:52.354 --> 00:00:56.373
Bird flew over to Kip.

4
00:00:56.374 --> 00:01:00.060
"I'm going to the beach, Kip," said Bird.

5
00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:02.859
"Do you want to come with me?"

6
00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:07.287
"No, thanks, Bird," said Kip sadly.

7
00:01:07.288 --> 00:01:10.448
"What's wrong?" asked Bird.

8
00:01:10.449 --> 00:01:15.986
"This is a horrible day," said Kip.

9
00:01:15.987 --> 00:01:21.198
"I lost my perfect acorn."

10
00:01:21.199 --> 00:01:25.526
"Oh, don't worry," said Bird.

11
00:01:25.527 --> 00:01:28.944
"You'll find another perfect acorn."

12
00:01:28.945 --> 00:01:39.144
Bird flew off.

13
00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:42.903
"Bird is right," thought Kip.

14
00:01:42.904 --> 00:01:50.913
"I'll look for another acorn."

15
00:01:50.914 --> 00:02:02.017
Kip went to the playground.

16
00:02:02.018 --> 00:02:06.185
He saw acorns on the steps.

17
00:02:06.186 --> 00:02:09.703
Kip climbed the first step.

18
00:02:09.704 --> 00:02:20.668
He found a cracked acorn.

19
00:02:20.669 --> 00:02:25.137
Kip climbed to the next step.

20
00:02:25.138 --> 00:02:28.344
He found a moldy acorn.

21
00:02:28.345 --> 00:02:33.452
"Eww!" said Kip.

22
00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:48.246
Kip climbed to the top of the steps.

23
00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:50.547
He stood on the bridge.

24
00:02:50.548 --> 00:02:56.986
But there were no more perfect acorns.

25
00:02:56.987 --> 00:03:00.710
This was a horrible day!
